      "text": "The fallback incorrectly says that rejecting modeled errors requires inspecting the trace, although a postcondition such as `⇓ outputs => ⌜outputs.allOk = true⌝` rejects errors through returned outputs. Fix: remove this restriction from both fallback messages and state that the postcondition determines how modeled errors affect the claim."
